(Acme Corp - Remote Work Policy) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Purpose) Tj T*
(This policy explains how employees can work from home or another remote) Tj T*
(location while staying productive and connected with their team.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Eligibility) Tj T*
(All full-time employees who have completed their probation period may) Tj T*
(work remotely up to three days per week, with approval from their manager.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Working hours) Tj T*
(Remote employees keep the same core hours as the office, 10:00 to 16:00,) Tj T*
(and should be reachable on the team chat during those hours.) Tj T*
